===Normal Mode===
*Small melee: 8348
*Large melee: 8351
*Small range: 8349
*Large range: 8352
*Small magic: 8350
*Large magic: 8353

===Hard Mode===
*Small melee: 10797
*Large melee: 10800
*Small ranged: 10798
*Large ranged: 10801
*Small magic: 10799
*Large magic: 10802

